# ---------- FDA regulatory events and SrLC records ----------
# SrLC gives approval dates but not the date each entry was posted. Availability is an UPPER BOUND taken from the
# Internet Archive: the first snapshot of the SrLC page that lists the entry (published no later than that instant;
# the true posting date is earlier and unknown, so using the bound is leakage-safe). An entry with no such snapshot
# keeps an unknown availability (fail-closed in as-of queries).

iatd:approval_suppl116 a owl:NamedIndividual , iat:LabelingSupplementApproval ;
